## Method

For EACH test function: state the inputs, trace the implementation's computation step by
step (do the arithmetic explicitly), state the value the test expects, and conclude PASS or
FAIL for that test. Check import/name compatibility first: if the tests cannot even import
the implementation, every test fails.

